            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Section 5, Trespass to Premises Act Arrest without warrant 5(1) A trespasser may be apprehended without warrant by (a) any peace officer, or (b) the owner or an authorized representative of the owner of the premises in respect of which the trespass is committed."
