            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "An individual is considered to be addicted to a substance when they  Give up activities, hobbies, friends, and relationships they formerly enjoyed in order to spend time using/abusing a substance  Will continue to use/abuse the substance even if doing so has negative effects on their well-being (e.g., health, financial, relationships)  Experience physical symptoms when they stop drinking or using drugs (withdrawal) As a security professional, you will encounter drug and alcohol abusers in situations such as these:"
