            "text": "Evidence must be collected and protected so that there is no opportunity for it to be tampered with. The police are the experts at collecting, packaging and preserving evidence but in your role as a security professional there is potential for you to encounter evidence and you have an obligation to preserve the scene and the evidence pending arrival of the police."
